00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two people make time for a quiet practice.
One learns a self-directed skill.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The other chooses a narrated recording.
Both may call it self-hypnosis.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
But those are not necessarily the
same kind of intervention.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.000
A review suggested learning and repeated
independent practice may matter.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
It did not test this branded
meditation-audio program.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Compare the exact promise
with the exact evidence.
